sequenceDiagram
    participant VM as ViewModel (Ch 2)
    participant Comp as Composable tree
    participant Leaf as Leaf composable
    participant GPU as Layout + Draw

    VM->>Comp: state changes (StateFlow)
    Comp->>Comp: recompose readers only (smart recomposition)
    alt params STABLE and unchanged
        Comp->>Leaf: SKIP - not re-run (fast)
    else params UNSTABLE (raw List / fresh lambda)
        Comp->>Leaf: RE-RUN every time (jank risk)
    end
    Leaf->>GPU: layout + draw within frame budget (~16ms)
    GPU-->>VM: frame on time = smooth, or late = jank (Ch 85)
